# 🌐 Product Management API Documentation

> Project: Product Management API
> Version: 1.0.0
> Base URL:
>
> http://localhost:5000/api

---

# Authentication

Some APIs require authentication.

Use:

Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

Example:

Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...

---

# User APIs

## 1. Register User

Method

POST

URL

http://localhost:5000/api/users/register

Body

```json
{
  "name": "Rahul",
  "email": "rahul@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}
```

Response

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "statusCode": 201,
  "message": "User registered successfully"
}
```

---

## 2. Login User

Method

POST

URL

http://localhost:5000/api/users/login

Body

```json
{
  "email": "rahul@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}
```

Response

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "statusCode": 200,
  "message": "Login successful",
  "data": {
    "user": {
      "name": "Rahul",
      "email": "rahul@gmail.com",
      "role": "admin"
    },
    "token": "JWT_TOKEN"
  }
}
```

---

## 3. User Profile (Protected)

Method

GET

URL

http://localhost:5000/api/users/profile

Authorization

Bearer Token

Response

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "_id": "...",
    "name": "Rahul",
    "email": "rahul@gmail.com",
    "role": "admin"
  }
}
```

---

# Product APIs

## 1. Create Product (Admin Only)

Method

POST

URL

http://localhost:5000/api/products

Authorization

Bearer Token

Body

```json
{
  "name": "Canon EOS R8",
  "description": "Professional mirrorless camera",
  "price": 35000,
  "category": "Camera",
  "brand": "Canon",
  "stock": 20,
  "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516035069371-29a1b244cc32"
}
```

Response

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "statusCode": 201,
  "message": "Product created successfully"
}
```

---

## 2. Get All Products

Method

GET

URL

http://localhost:5000/api/products

---

## 3. Get Product By ID

Method

GET

URL

http://localhost:5000/api/products/:id

Example

http://localhost:5000/api/products/6a37cd3362f228e534755de1

---

## 4. Update Product (Admin Only)

Method

PUT

URL

http://localhost:5000/api/products/:id

Example

http://localhost:5000/api/products/6a37cd3362f228e534755de1

Authorization

Bearer Token

Body

```json
{
  "name": "Canon EOS R8 Updated",
  "description": "Updated Camera",
  "price": 40000,
  "category": "Camera",
  "brand": "Canon",
  "stock": 15,
  "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516035069371-29a1b244cc32"
}
```

---

## 5. Delete Product (Admin Only)

Method

DELETE

URL

http://localhost:5000/api/products/:id

Example

http://localhost:5000/api/products/6a37cd3362f228e534755de1

Authorization

Bearer Token

