# RBAC (Role Based Access Control)

| API | Public | User | Admin |
|------|--------|------|--------|
| Register | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Login | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Profile | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Get Products | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Get Product By ID | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Create Product | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Update Product | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |
| Delete Product | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ |

