# API Response Format

Success Response

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "statusCode": 200,
  "message": "Success",
  "data": {}
}
```

Error Response

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Something went wrong",
  "timestamp": "2026-06-21T11:38:27.760Z"
}
```

